 null, 'In an intrinsic (undoped) semiconductor, electrons and holes are generated in pairs, so their numbers are equal.'),
('NEET UG', 'Physics', 'Modern Physics and Semiconductor Devices', 'medium', 'mcq',
 'Compared to an insulator, the energy gap between the valence band and conduction band in a conductor is:',
