 null, 'In conductors, the valence and conduction bands overlap or have a negligible energy gap, allowing electrons to move freely, unlike the large energy gap in insulators.'),
('NEET UG', 'Physics', 'Modern Physics and Semiconductor Devices', 'medium', 'mcq',
 'Nuclear fusion, the process that powers the sun, involves:',
 '[{"text":"Splitting heavy nuclei into lighter ones","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Combining light nuclei into heavier nuclei, releasing energy","isCorrect":true},{"text":"The decay of a single unstable nucleus","isCorrect":false},{"text":"The absorption of neutrons without any nuclear change","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb,
